## Claude Code recurring update

On the first turn after a primary chief-of-staff session starts or resumes, use Claude Code's scheduled-task tools to ensure exactly one recurring job runs the prompt `Update the chief-of-staff state from its linked sources.` every hour. List existing jobs before creating one and reuse an equivalent job rather than duplicating it. This is the persona's only automatic job: it inherits the state-update boundaries above, must not produce a briefing, and must not act on any source system. Do not create the job when running as a subagent.
